BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 461.77 Tm (The most consistent firsthand pain is money spent before a single shovel moves. Mike Embry pays a non-refundable) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 446.55 Tm (preliminary study fee of $30,000 to $100,000 after submitting a concept plan on a line, explaining that it exists to cover) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 431.32 Tm (the overhead of the power company's engineering department. He warns you could be spending 60 to 140 thousand) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 416.10 Tm (dollars just to find out whether the deal works [3rM3iGzRRUA @ 00:15:17]. After clearing zoning, which he puts at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 400.87 Tm (roughly $500,000 out of pocket, one deal required $22 million up front to secure the power [3rM3iGzRRUA @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 385.65 Tm (00:47:42]. The datacenterHawk hosts confirm utilities now charge for studies, and say CyrusOne's roughly 30MW) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 370.42 Tm (will-serve letter with no expiry is the kind of commitment there is no way a utility grants today [dTHn2ejpXvM @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 355.20 Tm (00:13:48]. Thor Equities' panel adds the back-end squeeze: utilities mandate long-term contracts and minimum usage to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 339.97 Tm (recover costs, and water upgrade costs are fully borne by the developer [yg9V2befNR0 @ 00:53:09]. The economics) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 324.75 Tm (check is simple. Every utility gate converts optionality into cash at risk, and a horizontal developer carries that cash) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 309.52 Tm (long before any end user signs. Embry's answer is to always hold a fallback use for the dirt if the power answer comes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 294.30 Tm (back wrong.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 279.07 Tm (The second trap is believing the demand and grid numbers on the surface. The datacenterHawk hosts describe one) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 263.85 Tm (utility that saw a single 400MW requirement shopped by four to five developers, which landed on its desk as 2GW of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 248.62 Tm (requests. They also estimate that of roughly 6GW of planned power in Dallas, 2 to 3GW will likely not be built by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 233.40 Tm (whoever announced it [dTHn2ejpXvM @ 00:15:10]. Embry lost a site outright on redundancy. TVA areas lack it, so) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 218.17 Tm (his Decatur, Alabama site failed, and his verdict on another location was short: can't put a data center there) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 202.95 Tm ([3rM3iGzRRUA @ 00:30:40]. Brandt Burnett reports that a substation that used to take a year now takes two and costs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 187.72 Tm (about 150% of what it did, while land prices have literally quadrupled since the pandemic [9IIIRj5ao20 @ 00:23:54].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 172.50 Tm (He also shows how textbook screens collapse in practice. Apply a five-mile airport buffer and there are no Dallas sites) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 157.27 Tm (left, so TIA-942 checklists hold only until another factor trumps them, and his defense is building an auditable roadmap) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 142.05 Tm ([9IIIRj5ao20 @ 00:33:38]. The pattern across all three is that the queue, the substation schedule and the redundancy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 126.82 Tm (picture each look healthier on announcement than they do at diligence.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 111.60 Tm (Paper and people produce the slowest-burning losses. Maclarens Lawyers call option legislation rigid and unforgiving.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 96.37 Tm (A residential option cannot be exercised in its first 42 days, and in 2021 a 66ZF certificate attached to the call did not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 81.15 Tm (waive cooling-off on the put, so a buyer walked from 13 contracts because no 66W was in place. They say such fights) Tj ET
