BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 413.77 Tm (The first trap is treating a signed agreement as the finish line. Keentel Engineering calls the ERCOT SGIA a "false) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 398.55 Tm (summit" and warns "The reality is far harsher." The QSA runs quarterly, so a missed prerequisite or failed model) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 383.32 Tm (quality test slips synchronization by a full quarter, costing "millions of dollars" in revenue [YabOCr0t9pI @ 00:00:58].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 368.10 Tm (The engineering gauntlet answers to two masters: ERCOT checks macro stability in PSSE v36, TSAT and PSCAD,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 352.87 Tm (while TSPs such as Oncor, CenterPoint, ETT, LCRA, CPS and Austin Energy each apply their own relay, harmonic,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 337.65 Tm (inrush and RTU/ICCP rules. PSCAD EMT is mandatory for all IBRs, and if MQT curves fail to overlay across all) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 322.42 Tm (models, the submittal is rejected [YabOCr0t9pI @ 00:05:25]. Keentel flags vendor data lockdown as the "single biggest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 307.20 Tm (schedule risk," and as-built models must reflect exact inverter firmware and PPC settings. On the cluster side, the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 291.97 Tm (firm warns of a "hardware penalty" from generic models, because "These upgrades can be extremely expensive") Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 276.75 Tm ([TM7qt8CCWxk @ 00:17:28]. Blueprint States lays out the full path, from request to cluster studies to allocated) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 261.52 Tm (upgrades to an agreement, and stresses that an agreement still does not mean commercial operation [v2cs7ZXTQH0 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 246.30 Tm (00:01:18].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 231.07 Tm (Study results can wreck a pro forma overnight. In the ISO-NE transitional cluster, 23 projects totaling 4,826.5 MW) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 215.85 Tm (drew $3.21B in upgrades, with allocations ranging from $0 to $541M, or $0 to $2,700/kW [TM7qt8CCWxk @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 200.62 Tm (00:05:05]. Upgrades of up to 93 months meant more than seven years of delay. Keentel prices the exit on a 200 MW) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 185.40 Tm (project with $178M allocated at $8.9M at 5%, $17.88M at 10% and $35.6M at 20% [TM7qt8CCWxk @ 00:09:17].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 170.17 Tm (Sarah Johnson's PJM data shows the volatility underneath: a median cost of about $50/kW, a 90th percentile of about) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 154.95 Tm ($400/kW, 13% of estimates shifting by more than $100/kW between studies, and costs above $100/kW making) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 139.72 Tm (withdrawal 22 percentage points more likely [M62wgLYBKBw @ 00:33:36]. Andy Knows It cites Berkeley and RMI) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 124.50 Tm (work showing developers walk away once interconnection exceeds 10% of capex. GridState describes the cascade: "A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 109.27 Tm (single project withdrawal can force studies to be rerun," and "Suddenly, a project that looked profitable no longer) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 94.05 Tm (works financially" [ObxvY1JRruo @ 00:04:22]. TVA's counter is a set of off-ramps for no material effect, a more than) Tj ET
