BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (and feeder headroom before a request is filed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (The second point of agreement is that a published number is a ceiling for screening, not a connection right. Alfonso) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Areti, LUMA's renewable energy integration manager, tells users that supplementary studies are necessary for any) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (feeder with DG penetration greater than 15%. LUMA's incremental capacity layer also covers only feeders already) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (verified in the field [UnmedCjwEb0 @ 00:04:49]. Dan Rogers, a Massachusetts distribution planning engineer at) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (National Grid, calls a displayed 5.2 MW value only an upper limit. A recloser without voltage supervisory control will) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (lower the downstream values [KxAPuQUu_II @ 00:14:37]. ESB Networks sends users to its details page, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (specifically to the FAQ asking whether the capacity available value means a customer can connect the amount shown) Tj ET
