BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 285.77 Tm (The most repeated trap is treating a published number as a connection right. National Grid's Dan Rogers stressed that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 270.55 Tm (the 5.2 MW shown on one feeder is only an upper limit. A recloser without voltage supervisory control will pull) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 255.32 Tm (downstream values lower, while earlier DG-funded upgrades such as a bidirectional recloser push them up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.10 Tm ([KxAPuQUu_II @ 00:14:37]. Rogers also flagged why map totals and field reality diverge. The map excludes 1.5 MW) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 224.87 Tm (of batteries and natural gas backup generators for hospitals, and the utility will not publish backup versus peaking units) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 209.65 Tm (because that is too customer specific [KxAPuQUu_II @ 00:13:53]. ESB Networks points every user to its details page,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 194.42 Tm (including the FAQ 'does the capacity available value mean I can connect the amount shown' [fqIsW9Rhp48 @) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.20 Tm (00:04:12]. California ISO gates its POI heat map behind an 'I agree' disclaimer and labels results for information only) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 163.97 Tm (and subject to change. In the live demo, entering 115 MW flipped Meadow Lane, which showed 31.86 MW, to orange,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 148.75 Tm (and red font in the results table marks a poor POI [YAtPW03BCrY @ 00:04:27]. Rogers added that a 13.8 kV to 4 kV) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 133.53 Tm (step-down lowers hosting capacity, and that flicker and 3V0 screens against minimum load were still coming in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 118.30 Tm (post-processing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.08 Tm (Headroom on a map also dies on distance, phase count and dirt. ESB Networks says a substation typically must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 87.85 Tm (within 300 meters to suit a low-voltage connection; otherwise a new substation must be provided nearer the site. ESB) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 72.63 Tm (also notes that substations and transformers are the longest lead-time component when they must be built or reinforced) Tj ET
