BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (voltages, temperatures, current and state of charge, and it immediately isolates affected components when conditions go) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (abnormal. The EMS sits above it, running charging schedules, market participation, grid support and utility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (communications. Keentel says that pairing turns a pile of batteries into an autonomous power plant [M2z-pv6j-N4 @) Tj ET
