BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 227.97 Tm (Action: Model TDD at the PCC, run EMT on weak grids, and set protection to directional or differential.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 212.75 Tm (Detail: Low-SCR grids can destabilize the PLL, so EMT modeling is required, and utilities require model submissions) Tj ET
