BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 301.77 Tm (The first trap fires at the kitchen table. Crystal Two Bulls reports that Microsoft, Google, Apple, Meta and Amazon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 286.55 Tm (approach through subsidiaries and native-owned energy companies with NDAs in hand, open with a solar pitch, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 271.32 Tm (pivot to a data center once the NDA is signed, leaving tribal leadership accountable to the corporations instead of their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 256.10 Tm (own people [Ac0-fBK0LVQ @ 00:03:27]. Tammy Clark and Kristen Meghan describe the same script on farmland:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 240.87 Tm (leases pitched as 'temporary' and 'probably never going to happen,' $10M offers to farmers, one family that refused) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 225.65 Tm ($25M, and sites picked specifically for weak zoning [S_6FoEr75bs @ 00:39:30]. The transmission side is blunter. In) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 210.42 Tm (Georgia, planned new lines jumped from 24 miles in 2019 to 1,065 miles, roughly 80% of the added 10 GW is for data) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 195.20 Tm (centers, and Georgia Power offered Rachael Maszk $57,000 for half a backyard while representatives raised eminent) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 179.97 Tm (domain mid-negotiation; the company's line is 'we use it less than 1 percent of the time' [e8QyJw6I-Bc @ 00:03:50].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 164.75 Tm (Doug Fergus lost a quarter of a backyard and roughly 400 trees to a power line, held out for more than a year, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 149.52 Tm (settled and paid down half the mortgage with the proceeds [e8QyJw6I-Bc @ 00:04:16].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 134.30 Tm (The second trap is believing the jobs-and-revenue story. Two Bulls puts numbers on it: up to 1,500 construction jobs,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 119.07 Tm (mostly not local, over a build phase of up to two years, then as few as three full-time jobs, as in Rapid City, South) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 103.85 Tm (Dakota, while Montana bills almost doubled and one person living alone in a trailer received a $900 bill) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 88.62 Tm ([Ac0-fBK0LVQ @ 00:11:53]. In Alberta, residents of Olds, a town of about 10,000 facing a proposed complex ten) Tj ET
