BT /F2 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 755.00 Tm (THE BIG MONEY PLAYBOOKS) Tj ET
0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (and no published papers yet prove the economic benefits [Rj_icscgo_Q @ 00:03:14]. Michael Webber names the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (timing problem directly: 'we feel the impacts today, the benefits come later,' and companies are very late to engage) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (communities, repeating the shale era [fkB8mt1DEVw @ 00:17:16]. Project Tango shows what that costs a developer:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (the zoning committee recommended denial, the light-industrial argument failed, and the Palm Beach County) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Commission killed the 1.5M sq ft expansion 5-1 even after FPL said data center companies fund 100% of new) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (generation, with a national protest day of roughly 100 events already planned [iYCYPKhdqcY @ 00:05:09].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (The third trap is physical and hits operators as hard as neighbors. The Latitude Media panel warns that) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (behind-the-meter builds can be invisible to utilities, much like cannabis grow houses; an overload trips the building) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (rather than the feeder, and spiky inference loads create power-quality, voltage and harmonics risk that the panel calls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (solvable, with storage as the fix [D7D1CPOoub4 @ 00:24:22]. Utilization is the hidden economics check: ProLogis) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (customers run at 25% of their 5, 10 or 20 MW interconnections, L3 chargers sit at roughly 15-30%, and EV tariffs) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (block added load unless the site opts into a C&I tariff, while office retrofits stall on fire code, server weight, cooling) Tj ET
